<mei xmlns="http://www.music-encoding.org/ns/mei" meiversion="5.0"><meiHead xml:lang="en"><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Pa 1118-194v-12</title></titleStmt><pubStmt><identifier>https://corpus-monodicum.de/d/444e5673-dfda-4df6-8094-151fe2badc71</identifier><respStmt><corpName role="publisher">Corpus Monodicum</corpName></respStmt><address><addrLine>Domerschulstraße 13</addrLine><addrLine>97070 Würzburg</addrLine></address><availability><useRestrict auth.uri="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/">CC BY-NC 4.0</useRestrict></availability><date isodate="2026-11-04"/></pubStmt><seriesStmt><title>Corpus Monodicum</title><respStmt><resp>Edition (Sequenzen)</resp><persName>Andreas Pfisterer</persName></respStmt><funder>Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur Mainz</funder></seriesStmt><notesStmt><annot startid="#m-856b4f61-0922-4430-b4f0-3264502ec2e3" endid="#m-6eacb70f-fde6-4008-b187-b14987786f25" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((formam)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((forma))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-6d7052df-3f8b-445f-864d-70647dc2935d" endid="#m-6d7052df-3f8b-445f-864d-70647dc2935d"><table><tr><td><rend>((At))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Die melismatische Aufzeichnung ((Pa 1118-142-4)) zeigt vom Ende von 6b zum Beginn von 7a eindeutig einen Quintsprung aufwärts und dann Schrittbewegung (vgl. dazu auch die Aufzeichnungen von ((Festa Christi))). Die textierten Aufzeichnungen ((Pa 1138-129v-2)) und ((Pa 1118-194v-12)) dagegen zeigen ebenso eindeutig einen unisonischen Anschluss und einen größeren Sprung von der ersten zur zweiten Note.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-299c2574-8d4c-4db8-8e53-3a6847535206" endid="#m-d744546a-a1df-4510-99a2-66a128b6a38f" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((| heloi))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((h | eloi)), lies ((eloi))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-3bd5c832-8825-4bf6-a68e-6757785d720c" endid="#m-926bc129-e704-4bee-850b-0593c79fc50f"><table><tr><td><rend>((Huna))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((Una))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-5db460f1-3d23-4c88-af0f-ba6ef44ab6a8" endid="#m-a12e1c79-5f13-47d1-9775-ae315e21ddd2"><table><tr><td><rend>((hostendis))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((ostendis))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-e1ebf2da-ab84-4f59-964b-6494691e4119" endid="#m-52cb9136-4d66-4643-984a-92f1e19bdf3f" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((ecclesia sancta)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((ecclesiam sanctam))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-1b649d4e-56a9-4ff0-8b68-ca393ebe6ad0" endid="#m-560f916b-5d04-4932-9cb0-da072a51717c"><table><tr><td><rend>((hunum))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((unum))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-f9279676-ed73-442a-8a17-c83ec4d38885" endid="#m-5ed44681-18a1-4c40-832b-0e72ab766ba9"><table><tr><td><rend>((hunum))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((unum))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-50df06f6-e16c-4e38-b8f8-dc00fe8917eb" endid="#m-b37baf5e-112f-4164-9efb-d20182faddf1"><table><tr><td><rend>((procedens de duas personas))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>grammatikalisch korrekt müsste es wohl heißen: ((procedentem de duobus personis)), das würde aber sowohl die Melodie als die a-Assonanz am Strophenende stören.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-ca461c31-241d-49ba-ab8d-3f71a801120b" endid="#m-b37baf5e-112f-4164-9efb-d20182faddf1"><table><tr><td><rend>((personas))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Text korrigiert, Buchstabe ((s)) über der Zeile zugefügt, Buchstabe ((n)) auf Rasur.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-645bd244-fed8-4ec2-b6eb-70f13a7a626b" endid="#m-654d8671-2e72-450a-b178-f77cc211717d"><table><tr><td><rend>((comune))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Rasur auf Textebene nach ((co-)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-68778228-9fe6-46a1-ac68-f6e65b563805" endid="#m-b29a0abc-36bd-48a3-b56f-639a6c26ca5d"><table><tr><td><rend>((hubi))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((ubi))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-c196d3ea-8172-4496-8fdb-6c764857fd36" endid="#m-e36e5ed7-557b-4d97-b466-26a24bc1acc3"><table><tr><td><rend>((hunus))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((unus))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-5f944101-052b-4af1-91bd-6a83665be3b2" endid="#m-4d22d415-dc59-4ebd-a467-8718e8238c58"><table><tr><td><rend>((persone))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>grammatikalisch plausibler: ((persona)) (wie ((AH))).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-586651bf-0071-4349-8116-01627cae498c" endid="#m-ef718e6b-64ba-4fba-9e72-2f6079659a6c"><table><tr><td><rend>((sua quam))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>grammatikalisch plausibler: ((suum quod)) (wie ((AH))).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-f787b485-29fa-48ff-8180-ca8b3d5cf7d6" endid="#m-dc21b9e3-d93f-47c7-ae11-edd8440419e0" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((| hunicum))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((h | unicum)), lies ((unicum)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-a309f3ef-7a33-43c6-8b95-ad11d3c5cc30" endid="#m-12179fd1-9221-4f47-8937-0c6b545cbf3e"><table><tr><td><rend>((dixerit))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>semantisch plausibler: ((direxit)) (wie ((AH))).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-085e4f10-11ce-453e-8c89-101eb62683ce" endid="#m-085e4f10-11ce-453e-8c89-101eb62683ce"><table><tr><td><rend>((in))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>davor angefangener Buchstabe ((f)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-pa-1118"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Pa 1118</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><app